{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1203"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/sculpture","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__sculpture.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",740],["+","Born Michelangelo di Lodovico Buonarroti Simoni in Caprese in 1475, the Florentine signed himself „Michelangelo Buonarroti“ and was painter, architect and poet as well as sculptor, but always called sculpture his true profession. "],["=",294],["-","(Michelangelo)"],["+","(Michelangelo"],["=",1],["+","Buonarroti) "],["=",67]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",710],["+","1475 in Caprese als Michelangelo di Lodovico Buonarroti Simoni geboren, unterschrieb der Florentiner mit „Michelangelo Buonarroti“ und war Maler, Architekt und Dichter ebenso wie Bildhauer, nannte aber stets die Bildhauerei seinen eigentlichen Beruf. "],["=",274],["-","(Michelangelo)"],["+","(Michelangelo"],["=",1],["+","Buonarroti) "],["=",69]]}]},
